Manual verification on touch — deferred to the Phase Verification
checkpoint (plan Task: Phase Verification & Checkpoint) with the rest of
the hands-on pass. On a touch device:
1. Tap a litter piece while spawned -> respond + morph to garbage, once
   (re-tapping the piece mid-morph is ignored).
2. Tap the owner house while carrying within 1.9 -> deliver; tap it from
   afar, or while the pup is still searching -> nothing happens.
3. Press the siren twice -> paw blooms on the first press only.
4. Mash two drive destinations quickly -> the newest route wins; a honk
   under the car never cancels the route in progress.
